* CABSRT18 - BILL PROOF SORT FOR THE OUT OF BALANCE LISTING
* SELECTS THE ACCOUNT LEVEL PROOF RECORDS THAT DID NOT BALANCE
* AND SORTS THEM BY THE SIZE OF THE DIFFERENCE, LARGEST FIRST,
* SO THAT THE CONTROL TEAM WORK THE BIGGEST ONE FIRST.
*
* THE INCLUDE TESTS THE RESULT TEXT WRITTEN BY CABBIL11 RATHER
* THAN THE DIFFERENCE FIELD.  A RECORD WHOSE DIFFERENCE IS INSIDE
* THE PROGRAM TOLERANCE CARRIES THE TEXT IN BALANCE AND IS NOT
* SELECTED HERE, WHATEVER THE DIFFERENCE FIELD ACTUALLY SAYS.
 SORT FIELDS=(66,8,PD,D)
 INCLUDE COND=(74,11,CH,EQ,C'OUT OF BAL ')
 OPTION EQUALS
 RECORD TYPE=F,LENGTH=120
